": 141.8, "x1": 412.5, "text": "felix eris s1 pecüniae gràtià vitae tuae parcent.\" 90"}, {"y0": 448.1, "x0": 152.6, "x1": 396.3, "text": "Gubernàtor: *Si necesse erit, decem milia sestertium"}, {"y0": 466.5, "x0": 141.8, "x1": 396.1, "text": "praedonibus offerre possum. Quod ipse nón possideo"}, {"y0": 484.8, "x0": 141.4, "x1": 268.5, "text": "amici mel pró mé solvent.\""}, {"y0": 502.7, "x0": 152.6, "x1": 396.1, "text": "Médus: *Ergo nülla spés est mihi, qui nec ipse pecü-"}, {"y0": 520.8, "x0": 141.6, "x1": 411.9, "text": "niam habeo nec amicum tam pecüniosum, ut mé é ser- 95"}, {"y0": 539.2, "x0": 141.2, "x1": 292.6, "text": "vitüte redimere possit aut velit.\""}], "margin": [{"y0": 104.3, "x0": 40.3, "x1": 120.0, "text": "dónec — dum, tam diü"}, {"y0": 115.5, "x0": 44.6, "x1": 64.4, "text": "quam"}, {"y0": 139.6, "x0": 40.6, "x1": 118.4, "text": "ab aliquo petere - ali-"}, {"y0": 150.4, "x0": 44.6, "x1": 89.2, "text": "quem rogare"}, {"y0": 172.0, "x0": 40.6, "x1": 120.5, "text": "dis-suàdére €» persua-"}, {"y0": 181.0, "x0": 46.0, "x1": 61.3, "text": "dére"}, {"y0": 190.9, "x0": 40.6, "x1": 83.6, "text": "neu — né-ve"}, {"y0": 199.4, "x0": 40.6, "x1": 120.2, "text": "re-sistere (-- dat) — re-"}, {"y0": 209.3, "x0": 44.9, "x1": 73.7, "text": "pugnare"}, {"y0": 217.5, "x0": 40.6, "x1": 94.8, "text": "opus esse «- abl"}, {"y0": 293.5, "x0": 40.6, "x1": 129.5, "text": "prae-ferre: mortem servi-"}, {"y0": 302.5, "x0": 44.9, "x1": 115.1, "text": "tüti p. - mori màlle"}, {"y0": 312.6, "x0": 44.9, "x1": 90.7, "text": "quam servire"}, {"y0": 321.4, "x0": 41.0, "x1": 114.4, "text": "haud sció an dixerim"}, {"y0": 330.2, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 97.7, "text": "— fortasse dixi"}, {"y0": 340.3, "x0": 40.4, "x1": 112.3, "text": "cárus — qui diligitur"}, {"y0": 377.0, "x0": 40.3, "x1": 119.8, "text": "grátia -ae f — rés gráta,"}, {"y0": 385.8, "x0": 44.6, "x1": 83.8, "text": "beneficium"}, {"y0": 426.0, "x0": 40.4, "x1": 129.0, "text": "pecüniae grátia — ob grà-"}, {"y0": 435.0, "x